### Banking Transactions API — sample requests (VS Code "REST Client" extension)
### Start the API first: ./demo/run.sh
@base = http://localhost:3000

### Health check
GET {{base}}/health

### Task 1 — Deposit 500 USD to ACC-12345 (201)
POST {{base}}/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "toAccount": "ACC-12345",
  "amount": 500,
  "currency": "USD",
  "type": "deposit"
}

### Task 1 — Transfer 100.50 USD from ACC-12345 to ACC-67890 (201, completed)
# @name transfer
POST {{base}}/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fromAccount": "ACC-12345",
  "toAccount": "ACC-67890",
  "amount": 100.50,
  "currency": "USD",
  "type": "transfer"
}

### Task 1 — Withdrawal exceeding balance (201, status = failed)
POST {{base}}/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fromAccount": "ACC-67890",
  "amount": 9999,
  "currency": "USD",
  "type": "withdrawal"
}

### Task 1 — List all transactions (200)
GET {{base}}/transactions

### Task 1 — Get transaction by id (200)
GET {{base}}/transactions/{{transfer.response.body.id}}

### Task 1 — Unknown transaction (404)
GET {{base}}/transactions/does-not-exist

### Task 1 — Account balance (200)
GET {{base}}/accounts/ACC-12345/balance

### Task 1 — Unknown account (404)
GET {{base}}/accounts/ACC-00000/balance

### Task 2 — Validation errors: amount, currency, account format (400)
POST {{base}}/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fromAccount": "12345",
  "toAccount": "ACC-6789",
  "amount": -10,
  "currency": "XYZ",
  "type": "transfer"
}

### Task 2 — Amount with more than 2 decimals (400)
POST {{base}}/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "toAccount": "ACC-12345",
  "amount": 10.123,
  "currency": "USD",
  "type": "deposit"
}

### Task 3 — Filter by account
GET {{base}}/transactions?accountId=ACC-12345

### Task 3 — Filter by type
GET {{base}}/transactions?type=transfer

### Task 3 — Filter by date range
GET {{base}}/transactions?from=2024-01-01&to=2030-12-31

### Task 3 — Combined filters
GET {{base}}/transactions?accountId=ACC-12345&type=transfer&from=2024-01-01&to=2030-12-31

### Task 3 — Invalid filters (400)
GET {{base}}/transactions?type=refund&from=2024-13-01

### Task 4C — Export all transactions as CSV
GET {{base}}/transactions/export?format=csv

### Task 4C — Export with filters
GET {{base}}/transactions/export?format=csv&accountId=ACC-12345&type=transfer

### Task 4C — Unsupported format (400)
GET {{base}}/transactions/export?format=xml
